{"places":[{"id":"H","label":"比特幣"},{"id":"U","label":"美元流動性"},{"id":"DL","label":"求償權(可轉債 + 優先股清算優先權)"},{"id":"S","label":"普通股股數"},{"id":"OUT","label":"流出系統"}],"assets":["H","U"],"sources":["DL","S"],"tools":[{"id":"convert_issue","label":"可轉債發行","kind":"atom","claims":"?","shares":"—","btc":"—","cebe":"稀釋","note":"與優先股發行同形。平價發行時 c = F,對 E 恰好中性 —— 真正的差別在價內時會轉成股票(見「可轉債轉股」),求償權自動消失,所以它是唯一會自己蒸發的那種槓桿。","bps":"\\Delta B = \\frac{c}{p\\,S}\\times 10^{8} > 0","eq":"\\Delta E = \\frac{c - F}{p\\,S}\\times 10^{8} \\le 0","moves":["DL","U"]},{"id":"buy_btc","label":"用現金買幣","kind":"atom","claims":"↑","shares":"—","btc":"↑","cebe":"中性","note":"買幣本身不創造價值。B 上升純粹因為它看不到錢是哪來的。","bps":"\\Delta B = \\frac{c}{p\\,S}\\times 10^{8} > 0","eq":"\\Delta\\!\\left(H - \\frac{C}{p}\\right) = \\frac{c}{p} - \\frac{c}{p} = 0","moves":["U","H"]},{"id":"sell_btc","label":"賣幣換現金","kind":"atom","claims":"↓","shares":"—","btc":"↓","cebe":"中性","note":"賣幣本身不會讓股東變窮。決定好壞的是那筆美元接下來拿去做什麼。","bps":"\\Delta B = -\\frac{x}{S}\\times 10^{8} < 0","eq":"\\Delta E = \\frac{-x + xp/p}{S}\\times 10^{8} = 0","moves":["H","U"]},{"id":"issue_preferred","label":"優先股發行","kind":"atom","claims":"?","shares":"—","btc":"—","cebe":"稀釋","note":"與「用現金買幣」串起來就是 phantom growth:B 上升而 E 下降。","bps":"\\Delta B = \\frac{c}{p\\,S}\\times 10^{8} > 0","eq":"\\Delta E = \\frac{c - F}{p\\,S}\\times 10^{8} \\le 0","moves":["DL","U"]},{"id":"buyback_preferred","label":"折價回購求償權","kind":"atom","claims":"?","shares":"—","btc":"—","cebe":"折價買回 = 加分","note":"ΔB = 0 不是四捨五入,是結構上的零 —— B 的式子裡沒有求償權這一項。","bps":"\\Delta B = 0","eq":"\\Delta E = \\frac{F - c}{p\\,S}\\times 10^{8} > 0 \\quad (c < F)","moves":["U","DL"]},{"id":"carry","label":"股息與債息","kind":"atom","claims":"↑","shares":"—","btc":"—","cebe":"減分","note":"其餘每一種操作的正負都取決於價格條件,只有這一項無條件為負。","bps":"\\Delta B = 0","eq":"\\Delta E = -\\frac{c}{p\\,S}\\times 10^{8} < 0","moves":["U","OUT"]},{"id":"common_atm","label":"普通股 ATM 增發","kind":"atom","claims":"↓","shares":"↑","btc":"—","cebe":"mNAV > 1 才加分","note":"B 的門檻比 E 高(因為 B > E 恆成立),所以一次增發可以對 E 加分、同時對 B 減分。","bps":"\\Delta B > 0 \\iff \\frac{P}{p}\\times 10^{8} > B","eq":"\\Delta E > 0 \\iff \\frac{P}{p}\\times 10^{8} > E \\iff m > 1","moves":["S","U"]},{"id":"common_buyback","label":"普通股回購","kind":"atom","claims":"↑","shares":"↓","btc":"—","cebe":"低於淨值才加分","note":"B 無條件上升但 m > 1 時 E 下降 —— 兩個指標正面打架。","bps":"\\Delta B = H\\left(\\frac{1}{S-n} - \\frac{1}{S}\\right)\\times 10^{8} > 0","eq":"\\Delta E > 0 \\iff \\frac{P}{p}\\times 10^{8} < E \\iff m < 1","moves":["U","S"]},{"id":"convert_conversion","label":"可轉債轉股","kind":"atom","claims":"↓","shares":"↑","btc":"—","cebe":"加分","note":"求償權整筆消失,但沒有多出任何一顆幣,所以 B 被稀釋。","bps":"\\Delta B = H\\left(\\frac{1}{S+n} - \\frac{1}{S}\\right)\\times 10^{8} < 0","eq":"\\Delta E > 0 \\iff \\frac{F/n}{p}\\times 10^{8} > E","moves":["DL","S"]},{"id":"atm_to_btc","label":"ATM 增發 → 買幣","kind":"combo","claims":"—","shares":"↑","btc":"↑","cebe":"mNAV > 1 才加分","note":"公司用得最多的一個組合 —— 逐週 8-K 寫的就是這句:\"bitcoin purchases were made using proceeds from the sale of shares under the ATM\"。兩個門檻不一樣:B 要贏過帳面每股,E 只要贏過實得每股,而 B 永遠大於 E —— 所以增發可能對 E 加分、同時對 B 減分。","bps":"\\Delta B > 0 \\iff \\frac{P}{p}\\times 10^{8} > B","eq":"\\Delta E > 0 \\iff \\frac{P}{p}\\times 10^{8} > E \\iff m > 1","moves":["S","U","H"]},{"id":"sell_to_buyback","label":"賣幣 → 折價回購優先股","kind":"combo","claims":"↓","shares":"—","btc":"↓","cebe":"折價買回 = 加分","note":"賣幣那一步是中性的,回購那一步把折價收進來。所以整個組合的加分恰好等於折價本身,跟賣了多少幣無關。","bps":"\\Delta B = -\\frac{x}{S}\\times 10^{8} < 0","eq":"\\Delta E = \\frac{F - c}{p\\,S}\\times 10^{8} > 0,\\quad c = xp","moves":["H","U","DL"]},{"id":"preferred_to_btc","label":"發優先股 → 買幣","kind":"combo","claims":"↑","shares":"—","btc":"↑","cebe":"稀釋","note":"phantom growth 的完整形狀:B 漂亮地上升,而那些幣是借來的。","bps":"\\Delta B = \\frac{c}{p\\,S}\\times 10^{8} > 0","eq":"\\Delta E = \\frac{c - F}{p\\,S}\\times 10^{8} \\le 0","moves":["DL","U","H"]},{"id":"atm_to_buyback","label":"ATM 增發 → 折價回購優先股","kind":"combo","claims":"↓","shares":"↑","btc":"—","cebe":"mNAV > 1 − d 就加分","note":"單純增發要 m > 1;錢拿去折價 d 買回優先股,門檻就降到 m > 1 − d。優先股被打到 73 折時門檻掉到 0.73 —— 即使普通股在折價交易,增發去買回優先股仍然加分。","bps":"\\Delta B = H\\left(\\frac{1}{S+n} - \\frac{1}{S}\\right)\\times 10^{8} < 0","eq":"\\Delta E > 0 \\iff \\frac{F/n}{p}\\times 10^{8} > E \\iff m > 1 - d","moves":["S","U","DL"]}]}